    Bug 2044291 - Document getters and setters as properties in AccountHubInput. r=freaktechnik


    JSDoc considers a getter and a setter as simply two methods with the same name,
    which makes sphinx-js raise an error and fail the generation of our source docs.
    As per https://github.com/jsdoc/jsdoc/issues/973 and others, their stance seems
    to be that getters and setters should not be documented separately, and should
    instead be documented together and as a property.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304033

